{"text": "The River.\n\n\"Wait! Wait!\" calls Ravi. He runs and runs.\n\nThe tram stops at the corner. Ravi gets on. He sits near a window.\n\nThe tram goes down, down, down. Ravi can see pink houses and blue houses. He can't see his kite. It is over his head.\n\nSoon it stops again. Ravi gets off. He looks up.\n\nThe kite is not there! The wind takes it again.\n\nThe kite flies over a high wall. Ravi can't go over the wall.\n\nThere are steps near it. Ravi runs down the steps. There are many, many steps!\n\nOn the wall, there is a black cat. It has big yellow eyes. It watches the kite, too.\n\n\"Do you see my kite?\" asks Ravi.\n\nThe cat looks at the sky. Then it looks at the river.\n\nNow Ravi is at the river. There are big boats and small boats.\n\nThere is no bridge here. Ravi can't go over the river.\n\nThen he sees the kite. It is on a white boat!\n\nThe boat is on the other side.\n\n\"Hello!\" calls Ravi. \"That is my kite!\"\n\nBut no one hears him. The wind is very strong.\n\nRavi sits down. He is tired. His legs hurt.\n\nHe looks at his watch. It is eleven o'clock. Lunch is at twelve.\n\nThen the white boat moves. It goes down the river.\n\nAnd the red kite goes with it!", "textSha256": "450c191ff9c8a9db98da1b76c3071eb889dd221064d5fdc1bbb07645a6156b4f", "voice_id": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL", "model_id": "eleven_v3", "speed": 0.9, "lang": "en", "parts": 1, "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "R", "i", "v", "e", "r", ".", "\n", "\n", "\"", "W", "a", "i", "t", "!", " ", "W", "a", "i", "t", "!", "\"", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "s", " ", "R", "a", "v", "i", ".", " ", "H", "e", " ", "r", "u", "n", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "r", "u", "n", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "T", "h", "e", " ", "t", "r", "a", "m", " ", "s", "t", "o", "p", "s", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "r", "n", "e", "r", ".", " ", "R", "a", "v", "i", " ", "g", "e", "t", "s", " ", "o", "n", ".", " ", "H", "e", " ", "s", "i", "t", "s", " ", "n", "e", "a", "r", " ", "a", " ",